        "original_id": "48be42dd-071b-56f7-a516-e9d5a1f97588",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Timothy Zahn\n- Works: Vision of the Future, Thrawn trilogy, Heir to the Empire trilogy, Survivor's Quest, Quadrail\n- Topics: Star Wars novels, science fiction series, fictional transport systems\n\nFacts:\n- Timothy Zahn wrote the best-selling science fiction novel series known as the Thrawn trilogy, which is also called the Heir to the Empire trilogy.\n- Vision of the Future is the second of the two Hand of Thrawn novels by Timothy Zahn, and those novels follow the Thrawn trilogy.\n- Vision of the Future was published in 1998 as a Star Wars novel by Timothy Zahn.\n- Survivor's Quest was written by Timothy Zahn as a sequel to his 1998 Star Wars novel Vision of the Future.\n- Timothy Zahn conceived the Quadrail as a fictional intra-galactic rail system.",
